    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d714">

                <pb facs="0749" n="491" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg491"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/1992</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Gerard</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Berlin</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-07-29T21:00:00+01:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 29, 1915, 9 p. m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received July 30, 11.55 a.
                        m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2652. Do not believe Germany will answer last note. May possibly offer verbally
                    to submit question damages <hi rendition="#italic">Lusitania</hi> to Hague.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gerard</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
